WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.150
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do at The SCP Foundation: Dr. Bright cannot

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.680
use “My evil twin did it” as a viable
excuse.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:12.789
The same goes for “My good twin did it”,
considering the implication.

00:00:12.789 --> 00:00:18.199
Weirder things have happened at the SCP Foundation
than having an evil twin, so maybe someone

00:00:18.199 --> 00:00:22.460
could make the excuse that their evil twin
committed some crime on their behalf.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.949
But the Bright family is one of the most well-known
dynasties in Foundation history, so nobody

00:00:26.949 --> 00:00:30.910
is going to believe that there’s a hidden
member of the family still out there.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:35.660
Maybe if SCP-963 had a perfect copy, you might
have an excuse here.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.260
But to the best of our knowledge, that is
not the case.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.260
Take your lumps, Jack.

